            {
                "entry_id": "877508a5-c2d7-34a4-912c-3790e3f67373",
                "word": "omnilingual",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c4aff4b-32e7-35ff-bb94-1b50af8d2f71",
                        "entry_id": "877508a5-c2d7-34a4-912c-3790e3f67373",
                        "glosses": [
                            "有能力說或理解所有語言的"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fd4f38d-487a-4e0f-9f10-60276cf8a245",
                                "sense_id": "3c4aff4b-32e7-35ff-bb94-1b50af8d2f71",
                                "text": "Sir, my omnilingual Diorama having recently appeared in your useful publication, unconnected with some of the proofs that it has a just claim to such a comprehensive title, I shall now, with your permission, submit a prospectus of my universal characters contrasted with those which are most current over the Asiatic Peninsula, to the inspection of many Orientalists among your readers, very well qualified to decide impartially on the comparative merits of my scheme, at least in its application to the two indispensable languages for British India: namely, the Hindoostanee and Persian tongue.",
                                "translation": "先生，我的全語言立體模型最近登上了貴方實用的刊物，但卻沒有附上它之所以配得上這麼一個涵蓋廣泛之名稱的相關證據；現在，若您允許，我將提交一份關於我的通用文字的計畫書，與亞洲半島最通行的文字作對比，供您讀者中眾多的東方學者檢視，他們非常有資格對我這個方案的相對優點做出公正的評判，至少在將其應用於英屬印度的兩種不可或缺的語言（即印度斯坦語和波斯語）方面是如此。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ab8fb59-dbb9-498d-8f92-fb7631bb7a2c",
                                "sense_id": "3c4aff4b-32e7-35ff-bb94-1b50af8d2f71",
                                "text": "Because they are in some sense part of an omnilingual scholarly vocabulary, many instructors require their students to learn them and use them.",
                                "translation": "因為它們在某種意義上是全語言學術詞彙的一部分，許多講師會要求學生學習並使用它們。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae47d4e3-7c3b-4dd1-b861-e5ae8b332453",
                                "sense_id": "3c4aff4b-32e7-35ff-bb94-1b50af8d2f71",
                                "text": "The Sandpipers are omnilingual and sing in 11 different languages.",
                                "translation": "The Sandpipers 合唱團是全語言的，並使用 11 種不同的語言演唱。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
